  "design_caveats": {
    "D_same_delivery_time": "Conditions on delivery time, which the promise partly causes (bunching before the promise): a mediator. Within a delivery-day cell a late order is one abnormally slow for its lane (lost parcel, re-shipment). Descriptive only.",
